{"id":"665431","name":"西红柿烩饭","author":"双鱼座的美食","authorId":"11350065","desc":"","cover":"images/665431/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"半碗"}],"sub":[{"name":"西红柿","amount":"1个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"火腿肠","amount":"1根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材：剩米饭一个西红柿一根火腿肠两个鸡蛋葱花。","img":"images/665431/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"调料汁：两勺生抽一勺白糖一勺蚝油一勺番茄酱半勺盐半勺淀粉半碗清水，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665431/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋炒好。","img":"images/665431/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"葱花爆香。","img":"images/665431/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入番茄丁翻炒，炒一分钟。","img":"images/665431/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入汤汁，小火咕嘟两三分钟。","img":"images/665431/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入火腿丁，鸡蛋。","img":"images/665431/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"汤收粘稠。","img":"images/665431/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入米饭，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665431/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/665431/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}